2.007" end="12.168">Till</span> <span begin="12.168" end="12.320">the</span> <span begin="12.320" end="12.568">day</span> <span begin="12.568" end="12.898">that</span> <span begin="12.898" end="12.981">I</span> <span begin="12.981" end="13.228">die</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至我生命终结那天</span></p><p begin="13.293" end="15.343" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.293" end="14.166">Dead</span> <span begin="14.166" end="14.929">in</span><span begin="14.929" end="15.343">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心荒芜一片</span></p><p begin="15.420" end="16.523" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="15.420" end="15.525">I</span> <span begin="15.525" end="15.706">just</span> <span begin="15.706" end="15.827">wanna</span> <span begin="15.827" end="16.028">feel</span> <span begin="16.028" end="16.523">alive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只想感觉到 自己还活着</span></p><p begin="16.904" end="18.613" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.904" end="17.221">With</span> <span begin="17.221" end="17.515">you,</span> <span begin="17.515" end="17.917">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="17.917" end="18.613">alive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多亏有你 鲜活我的灵魂</span></p><p begin="18.783" end="19.795" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="18.783" end="18.918">With</span> <span begin="18.918" end="19.162">you,</span> <span begin="19.162" end="19.390">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="19.390" end="19.795">alive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你相伴 我才生机盎然</span></p><p begin="19.944" end="23.286" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.944" end="20.489">Fell</span> <span begin="20.489" end="20.821">in</span> <span begin="20.821" end="21.065">love,</span> <span begin="21.251" end="21.409">but</span> <span begin="21.409" end="21.566">it</span> <span begin="21.566" end="22.006">left</span> <span begin="22.006" end="22.526">me</span> <span begin="22.526" end="23.286">lonely</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坠入爱河 却落得孑然一身</span></p><p begin="23.286" end="26.591" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.286" end="23.717">Tried</span> <span begin="23.717" end="24.115">to</span> <span begin="24.115" end="24.597">trust,</span> <span begin="24.597" end="24.799">but</span> <span begin="24.799" end="25.012">it</span> <span begin="25.012" end="25.355">burned</span> <span begin="25.355" end="25.679">me</span> <span begin="25.679" end="26.591">slowly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">付诸信任 却被那文火煎心</span></p><p begin="27.340" end="30.198" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.340" end="27.495">I</span> <span begin="27.495" end="28.092">didn&apos;t</span> <span begin="28.092" end="28.593">know</span> <span begin="28.593" end="28.842">what</span> <span begin="28.842" end="28.985">I</span> <span begin="28.985" end="29.256">was</span> <span begin="29.256" end="29.690">looking</span> <span begin="29.690" end="30.198">for</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道我到底在寻找什么</span></p><p begin="30.813" end="37.080" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.813" end="31.643">Till</span> <span begin="31.643" end="32.456">I</span> <span begin="32.456" end="33.229">found</span> <span begin="33.229" end="37.080">her</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到寻得她 才豁然开朗</span></p><p begin="38.370" end="44.876" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.370" end="39.182">I</span> <span begin="39.182" end="39.987">found</span> <span begin="39.987" end="44.876">her</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我寻觅到了她</span></p><p begin="45.036" end="51.482" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.036" end="46.644">Without</span> <span begin="46.644" end="51.482">her</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失去她</span></p><p begin="47.244" end="51.219" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="47.244" end="47.363">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="47.363" end="47.435">a</span> <span begin="47.435" end="47.973">mess,</span> <span begin="47.973" end="48.222">there</span> <span begin="48.222" end="48.379">was</span> <span begin="48.379" end="48.638">nothing</span> <span begin="48.638" end="48.898">&apos;bout</span> <span begin="48.898" end="49.171">that</span> <span begin="49.171" end="49.458">love</span> <span begin="49.458" end="49.738">that</span> <span begin="49.738" end="50.018">made</span> <span begin="50.018" end="50.455">sense,</span> <span begin="50.455" end="50.633">I</span> <span begin="50.633" end="50.729">was</span> <span begin="50.729" end="51.219">stressed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彷徨不定 有关于爱 毫无头绪 我深感千钧重负</span></p><p begin="51.242" end="58.540" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.242" end="51.656">Till</span> <span begin="51.656" end="52.487">I</span> <span begin="52.487" end="53.295">found</span> <span begin="53.295" end="58.540">her</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">后来寻得她 灵魂才轻盈</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="54.649" end="57.471"><span begin="54.649" end="56.057">(Ohh,</span><span begin="56.057" end="57.471">ohh)</span></span></p><p begin="59.981" end="1:03.171" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="59.981" end="1:00.304">Found</span> <span begin="1:00.304" end="1:00.609">me</span> <span begin="1:00.831" end="1:01.488">lonely,</span> <span begin="1:01.659" end="1:02.089">lost,</span> <span begin="1:02.089" end="1:02.348">and</span> <span begin="1:02.503" end="1:03.171">only</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时你寻得 孤独迷惘 形单影只的我</span></p><p begin="1:03.329" end="1:06.411" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:03.329" end="1:03.504">One</span> <span begin="1:03.504" end="1:03.864">step</span> <span begin="1:03.864" end="1:04.343">away</span> <span begin="1:04.343" end="1:04.692">from</span> <span begin="1:04.692" end="1:04.989">just</span> <span begin="1:04.989" end="1:05.541">giving</span> <span begin="1:05.541" end="1:05.707">up</span> <span begin="1:05.707" end="1:06.411">slowly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">濒临放弃边缘 缓缓徘徊</span></p><p begin="1:06.608" end="1:08.332" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.608" end="1:06.862">I</span> <span begin="1:06.862" end="1:06.924">was</span> <span begin="1:06.924" end="1:06.991">a</span> <span begin="1:06.991" end="1:07.470">mess,</span> <span begin="1:07.470" end="1:07.549">I</span> <span begin="1:07.549" end="1:07.688">was</span> <span begin="1:07.688" end="1:08.332">afraid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">狼狈不堪 惊惧交加</span></p><p begin="1:08.765" end="1:12.021" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.765" end="1:08.904">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="1:08.904" end="1:09.006">be</span> <span begin="1:09.006" end="1:09.107">the</span> <span begin="1:09.107" end="1:09.395">girl</span> <span begin="1:09.395" end="1:09.709">who</span> <span begin="1:09.709" end="1:09.995">just</span> <span begin="1:09.995" end="1:10.064">put</span> <span begin="1:10.064" end="1:10.112">up</span> <span begin="1:10.112" end="1:10.253">her</span> <span begin="1:10.253" end="1:10.807">walls</span> <span begin="1:10.807" end="1:10.933">no</span> <span begin="1:10.933" end="1:11.086">one</span> <span begin="1:11.086" end="1:11.245">could</span> <span begin="1:11.245" end="1:12.021">break</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我这样的女孩 只好筑起心墙 拒人于千里之外</span></p><p begin="1:12.064" end="1:13.519" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:12.064" end="1:12.479">Till</span> <span begin="1:12.479" end="1:12.850">I</span> <span begin="1:12.850" end="1:13.287">found</span> <span begin="1:13.287" end="1:13.519">him</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到我遇见他</span></p><p begin="1:13.757" end="1:16.358" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:13.757" end="1:14.164">Running</span> <span begin="1:14.164" end="1:14.252">through</span> <span begin="1:14.252" end="1:14.366">the</span> <span begin="1:14.366" end="1:14.742">wild</span> <span begin="1:14.742" end="1:14.999">with</span> <span begin="1:14.999" end="1:15.303">half</span> <span begin="1:15.303" end="1:15.608">of</span> <span begin="1:15.608" end="1:15.793">a</span> <span begin="1:15.793" end="1:16.358">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只剩半颗心 穿越荒原的他</span></p><p begin="1:16.631" end="1:19.629" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:16.631" end="1:16.970">Made</span> <span begin="1:16.970" end="1:17.324">me</span> <span begin="1:17.324" end="1:17.441">a</span> <span begin="1:17.441" end="1:17.984">whole</span> <span begin="1:17.984" end="1:18.258">one</span> <span begin="1:18.258" end="1:18.657">out</span> <span begin="1:18.657" end="1:18.876">of</span> <span begin="1:18.876" end="1:19.121">the</span> <span begin="1:19.121" end="1:19.629">parts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">捧起我碎了满地的心 拼凑完整的他</span></p><p begin="1:19.914" end="1:21.227" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:19.914" end="1:20.288">Suddenly,</span> <span begin="1:20.288" end="1:20.403">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:20.403" end="1:20.657">like</span> <span begin="1:20.657" end="1:20.847">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:20.847" end="1:21.227">healed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍然间 伤痕尽愈</span></p><p begin="1:21.640" end="1:23.078" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:21.640" end="1:22.089">Didn&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:22.089" end="1:22.330">know</span> <span begin="1:22.330" end="1:22.466">the</span> <span begin="1:22.466" end="1:22.636">love</span> <span begin="1:22.636" end="1:22.778">was</span> <span begin="1:22.778" end="1:23.078">real</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我这才明白 世上有真爱存在</span></p><p begin="1:23.343" end="1:26.517" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:23.343" end="1:24.990">Until</span> <span begin="1:24.990" end="1:25.724">I</span> <span begin="1:25.724" end="1:26.517">could</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一刻 我得以</span></p><p begin="1:26.560" end="1:29.000" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:26.560" end="1:27.476">Hold</span> <span begin="1:27.476" end="1:28.254">you</span> <span begin="1:28.254" end="1:29.000">close</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧紧拥你入怀</span></p><p begin="1:28.600" end="1:29.799" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.600" end="1:28.864">Look</span> <span begin="1:28.864" end="1:29.006">me</span> <span begin="1:29.006" end="1:29.248">dead</span> <span begin="1:29.248" end="1:29.397">in</span> <span begin="1:29.397" end="1:29.526">my</span> <span begin="1:29.526" end="1:29.799">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">目不转睛 凝视我双眼</span></p><p begin="1:30.004" end="1:32.287" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:30.004" end="1:30.851">Dead</span> <span begin="1:30.851" end="1:31.664">in</span> <span begin="1:31.664" end="1:32.287">mine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凝视我双眼</span></p><p begin="1:31.951" end="1:33.003" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.952" end="1:32.187">Till</span> <span begin="1:32.187" end="1:32.382">the</span> <span begin="1:32.382" end="1:32.536">day</span> <span begin="1:32.536" end="1:32.721">that</span> <span begin="1:32.721" end="1:32.770">I</span> <span begin="1:32.770" end="1:33.003">die</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至我生命终结那天</span></p><p begin="1:33.272" end="1:35.689" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:33.272" end="1:34.110">Dead</span> <span begin="1:34.110" end="1:34.789">in</span><span begin="1:34.789" end="1:35.689">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心荒芜一片</span></p><p begin="1:35.259" end="1:36.538" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.259" end="1:35.326">I</span> <span begin="1:35.326" end="1:35.