得孑然一身</span></span></p><p begin="1:43.227" end="1:46.813" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:43.227" end="1:43.681">Tried</span> <span begin="1:43.681" end="1:44.045">to</span> <span begin="1:44.045" end="1:44.411">trust,</span> <span begin="1:44.411" end="1:44.680">but</span> <span begin="1:44.680" end="1:44.954">it</span> <span begin="1:44.954" end="1:45.375">burned</span> <span begin="1:45.375" end="1:45.666">me</span> <span begin="1:45.666" end="1:46.813">slowly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">付诸信任 却被那文火煎心</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:43.227" end="1:46.813"><span begin="1:43.227" end="1:43.681">(Tried</span> <span begin="1:43.681" end="1:44.045">to</span> <span begin="1:44.045" end="1:44.411">trust,</span> <span begin="1:44.411" end="1:44.680">but</span> <span begin="1:44.680" end="1:44.954">it</span> <span begin="1:44.954" end="1:45.375">burned</span> <span begin="1:45.375" end="1:45.666">me</span> <span begin="1:45.666" end="1:46.813">slowly)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">付诸信任 却被那文火煎心</span></span></p><p begin="1:47.289" end="1:50.363" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:47.289" end="1:47.458">I</span> <span begin="1:47.458" end="1:47.980">didn&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:47.980" end="1:48.526">know</span> <span begin="1:48.526" end="1:48.649">what</span> <span begin="1:48.649" end="1:48.935">I</span> <span begin="1:48.935" end="1:49.153">was</span> <span begin="1:49.153" end="1:49.995">looking</span> <span begin="1:49.995" end="1:50.363">for</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道我到底在寻找什么</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:47.289" end="1:50.363"><span begin="1:47.289" end="1:47.458">(I</span> <span begin="1:47.458" end="1:47.980">didn&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:47.980" end="1:48.526">know</span> <span begin="1:48.526" end="1:48.649">what</span> <span begin="1:48.649" end="1:48.935">I</span> <span begin="1:48.935" end="1:49.153">was</span> <span begin="1: